---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import { Sparkles, CheckCircle2, ArrowRight, Zap, Radio, Cpu, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-preact';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Changelog"
  description="Latest releases, improvements, and updates to the Bloom ecosystem."
  currentSlug="changelog"
  category="Getting Started"
  toc={[
    { id: 'v0-2-0', title: 'v0.2.0 — High-Throughput Realtime Cluster' },
    { id: 'v0-1-0', title: 'v0.1.0 — Initial Release' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Changelog
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        All notable changes and releases for the Bloom framework, UI components, server ecosystem, and CLI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- v0.2.0 -->
    <section id="v0-2-0" class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20">
          v0.2.0
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">August 2026</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">Latest</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/40 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <Radio className="w-4 h-4 text-pink-400" />
            <span>High-Throughput Realtime Cluster &amp; Zero-Allocation Pub/Sub</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Major performance upgrade to <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">bloom_realtime</code>, introducing multi-isolate cluster port sharing, zero-allocation broadcast hot paths, and 78,000+ msgs/sec delivery at 3.70 MB RAM.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
            Highlights
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>BloomRealtimeCluster</strong>: Multi-isolate cluster orchestrator distributing incoming WebSocket connections across all CPU cores via kernel-level port sharing (<code class="font-mono text-purple-400">shared: true</code>) and in-memory <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">SendPort</code> mesh routing.</li>
            <li><strong>Zero-Allocation Fan-Out</strong>: Eliminated 50,000 intermediate map lookups and heap list allocations in <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">BloomChannelHub.broadcast()</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Optimized Socket Upgrader</strong>: <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">BloomChannelHub.upgrade()</code> now disables zlib deflate by default (<code class="font-mono text-purple-400">CompressionOptions.compressionOff</code>), saving 15-25% CPU on small JSON events.</li>
            <li><strong>Binary Frame Support</strong>: Added <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">msg.encodeBytes()</code> and <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">asBinary: true</code> streaming support across client and server.</li>
            <li><strong>Verified Performance</strong>: Sustained <strong>78,125 msgs/sec</strong> fan-out delivery across 1,000 live WebSockets on 8 vCPUs with <strong>3.70 MB total RSS memory</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- v0.1.0 -->
    <section id="v0-1-0" class="space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
          v0.1.0
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">August 2026</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-slate-50/50 dark:bg-zinc-950/40 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <Sparkles className="w-4 h-4 text-purple-400" />
            <span>100% shadcn/ui Parity for Flutter</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Initial public release of Bloom UI with 60+ primitives and pure Dart charts built from scratch with zero runtime dependencies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
            Highlights
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
            <li><strong>60+ Primitives</strong>: Button, Card, Dialog, Sheet, Drawer, Table, Sidebar, Tabs, Calendar, Combobox, and more.</li>
            <li><strong>Pure Dart Chart Suite</strong>: Area, Bar, Line, Pie, Radar, and Radial charts with responsive drag tooltip tracking.</li>
            <li><strong>8 Style Presets</strong>: Nova, Vega, Maia, Lyra, Mira, Luma, Sera, Rhea with dark mode synchronization.</li>
            <li><strong>CLI Workflow</strong>: Full support for <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">bloom ui init</code> and <code class="font-mono text-purple-400">bloom ui add</code>.</li>
            <li><strong>Pub.dev Release</strong>: Officially published under <code class="font-mono text-emerald-400">bloom_ui: ^0.1.0</code>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Next Page Footer -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-zinc-800 flex justify-between">
      <a
        href="/docs/typography"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-zinc-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800 transition"
      >
        <span>Previous: Typography</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/ui"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-purple-600 text-white font-bold text-xs hover:bg-purple-500 transition shadow-lg"
      >
        <span>Explore All Components</span>
        <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
